title: 밤_4_편의점_서은표_영문
---
(It was the middle of the night when I finished my shift at the convenience store.)
(I was fixing my shoes to head home when someone suddenly approached me.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: It's {name()}! What are you doing up so late?
{name()}: Oh, hey. I just finished my part-time job.
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Whaaat~? You must be exhausted.
EunPyo: Heading home now?
{name()}: Yeah. I need to get some rest.
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Any plans for tomorrow?
{name()}: Hmm... nothing in particular.
{name()}: I should enjoy tonight while it lasts.
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 50 && get("otk") >= 3>>
    <<jump 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_호감도60이상_영문>>
