title: 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_호감도60이상_영문
---
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: If... if you don't have anything to do right now,
EunPyo: Do you want to come over to my place and hang out?
{name()}: Your place?
{name()}: Is it really okay for me to go this late?
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Yeah, I live alone, so it's fine.
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<choice 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_긍정1_영문 "Sounds good." 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_부정1_영문 "But at this hour..." >>
EunPyo: It's nearby, and... I have a spare bed, so you can just relax and head out whenever...
===

title: 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Sounds good.
{name()}: If you're okay with it, I'd love to.
<<jump 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: But at this hour, it might be a bit...
<<show pyo_spec>>
<<play 서은표_허>>
EunPyo: I have a beam projector... snacks... and even a body pillow...
(EunPyo's eyes are sparkling.)
(It's obvious she really wants me to come over.)
{name()}: If you insist... alright.
{name()}: I'll take you up on that.
<<jump 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_분기1_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
<<show pyo_smile>>
(An excited EunPyo led the way.)
(Her place was indeed very close.)
<<bg 특_자취방>>
<<show pyo_idle>>
(We entered a clean studio apartment. Her place was a very neat two-room suite.)
(I was impressed by how nice it was for a student apartment.)
{name()}: I’d believe you if you said this was a hotel.
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Oh, stop. It's not that great.
EunPyo: Make yourself at home.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Want to watch the new episode of 'Dol-Se-Ah-Ttae' Season 3?
{name()}: Oh, I'd love to. I've been wanting to see that.
(EunPyo set up the beam projector.)
(With the video playing and the lights off, it felt just like a movie theater.)
(We sat comfortably on beanbags and watched the screen.)
{name()}: Wow, do you watch anime like this every time?
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Yeah... it makes me never want to leave the house.
(How much time had passed while we watched 'Dol-Se-Ah-Ttae' and shared our thoughts?)
(As we adjusted our positions on the beanbags, we had grown quite close.)
<<hide>>
<<bg 서은표_특수>>
EunPyo: ...
{name()}: ...
<<play 공통_애니>>
(While the ending song of 'Dol-Se-Ah-Ttae' played, we stopped talking and just looked at each other.)
(............)
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
(Wait, this vibe... could it be...?)
(It was that exact moment, just a second away from a kiss.)
<<bg 특_자취방>>
(I saw something under the beanbag across from EunPyo.)
(Those are... printed photos.)
(And they were clearly photos from my Star-gram.)
(From my profile picture to my most recent posts. They were blurry, but the composition and colors were undeniably mine.)
<<choice 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_긍정2_영문 "Wait, what's that under the beanbag?" 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_부정2_영문 "(Don't ask about the photos.)" >>
(Should I ask about the photos?)
===

title: 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_긍정2_영문
---
{name()}: Wait, what's that under the beanbag?
(I stopped what I was doing and pointed under the beanbag.)
<<show pyo_neg2>>
EunPyo: Huh...?
(I stood up and walked over. They were definitely photos of me.)
(I picked them up and looked through them.)
(It wasn't just one or two. There were group photos, too...)
{name()}: What is all this? Why are these here?
<<bgm_stop>>
<<show pyo_horror>>
<<wait 2>>
<<bgm_resume>>
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: What do you mean? They're photos of you.
EunPyo: Why don't you recognize them~?
{name()}: I mean, why are they *here*?
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Why? Don't you like the photos?
{name()}: No... I mean, why do you *have* them?
<<show pyo_neg2>>
EunPyo: I thought they turned out well, so I had them printed.
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_허>>
EunPyo: Should I print out some others that you like better??
{name()}: ... ...
<<notice "You feel the atmosphere turn cold.">>
<<change karma +2>>
(It feels like there's no point in asking further.)
{name()}: Never mind... let's just keep watching the anime.
EunPyo: Okay.
(EunPyo seems a bit disappointed.)
(I wanted to press her more, but I lost all my will looking at that innocent smile.)
<<jump 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_분기2_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_부정2_영문
---
(It's probably best not to pry.)
{name()}: ...I'm going to use the restroom for a second.
(I stood up amidst the awkward atmosphere.)
(After coming back, I sat down on the beanbag again, keeping more distance than before.)
(Nothing much happened after that.)
<<jump 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_분기2_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_분기2_영문
---
(We finished the anime and talked about it.)
{name()}: It's getting really late... I should head out now.
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: I told you you could stay the night...
{name()}: No, it's fine. Get some rest.
{name()}: See ya.
(I went home with a lingering question that remained unanswered.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주4_목_밤_편의점_서은표_호감도60미만_영문
---
(Should I grab a late-night snack at the convenience store?)
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: If you've got nothing to do, want to grab a snack at the convenience store together?
EunPyo: You must be hungry after working.
{name()}: Oh, sounds good!
{name()}: Should we get cup noodles?
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
EunPyo: I'd love that.
EunPyo: I was just heading to the convenience store for a snack myself.
(We took a seat at the outdoor table of the convenience store.)
(We ate cup noodles while talking about school.)
(It tastes even better after finishing a shift.)
<<end>>
